{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI arrived in Breda just as the light was failing, having taken the evening coach from here. The air was cool, a relief after the Dutch heat. I was shown a tomb monument here, ascribed to Michelangelo, though I suspect the attribution is more wishful thinking than fact. It features a count and his wife in alabaster on a black slab, supported by four standing figures at the corners: Julius Caesar, Hannibal, and Regulus. It is a curious mix of pagan virtue and domestic repose. The composition feels heavy, the stone dark, yet there is a quiet dignity to the dead couple that surpasses the stiff, heroic posturing of the living figures above them. I paid the keeper two guilders to see it, which I think was fair.\n\nI am tired. The food in the coach was mediocre, but the wine passable. I hope the boys are behaving themselves in Berlin. Write to me soon.\n\nYour loving,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795219321,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":209,"prompt_tokens":1118,"total_tokens":1327,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-noa9c8IZS4brkJTmNkMRQYxC6t4p7XSx","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1118,"prompt_ms":1119.116,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0009982110912343,"prompt_per_second":999.0027843404973,"predicted_n":209,"predicted_ms":4897.784,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.54703846153846,"predicted_per_second":42.468185612105394}}